    "Implement Silver loss-audited typed transform, source-qualified identity, reversible relationships and complete field lineage",
    "Implement Gold business projection with exact denominator, time grain, reviewed inclusion status and source age",
    "Implement Platinum intelligence projection with uncertainty, evidence chain and human release gate",
    "Reconcile model sourceColumn, visual/scorecard/RDL field refs with friendly headings; preserve compatibility; test reverse mapping",
    "Add synthetic replay, source-drift, null, duplicate, stale, denial, retry and recovery tests; compare against retained accepted receipts",
    "Run local schema/contract/security gates; checkpoint source acceptance, then separately request authorised native readback and signoff"
